  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New implementation models &#x2013; Barriers to the assessment, delivery, servicing, training and wider support of AT are reduced through new approaches and platforms in order to strengthen systems.&#x200b;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
